{"cell": "w14-referent", "word": "مَّا (word 14)", "type": "referent", "topic": "مَّا (word 14) · referent", "words": ["مَّا يَتَذَكَّرُ فِيهِ مَن تَذَكَّرَ"], "view": "Another reported threshold is fifty years; poetry depicts fifty as advanced age and near death.", "rows": ["IBNATIYYA-FULL:v4p441/r2", "ABUHAYYAN-FULL:v9p36#2/r4", "ALUSI-FULL:v22p201/r3"], "note": ""}
